Then `lex_config` calls `next()` which returns `'\0'` and sets `pos = end + 1`. Then `chr == '\0'` breaks the loop. Then `emit(lexer, LEXEME_LINEFEED)` and `emit(lexer, LEXEME_EOF)`.

